\title{Statement on LLMs}
\author{brentyorgey}
\date{2026-03-07T21:55:40Z}

\p{I do not and will not use LLMs, in any form, for any purpose.  Although LLMs are fascinating from a purely technical perspective, I refuse to participate in or contribute to such systems that are built on massive exploitation of human labor (among other reasons).}
